## Purpose
Use this skill to produce deterministic guidance for frontend performance decisions, implementations, and tradeoffs.

## When to Use
Use this skill when the task centers on frontend performance and the answer must be structured, actionable, and reusable.

## Input Format
Provide the data defined in `# Input Format` below. If data is missing, state assumptions before continuing.

